269	// `run --mode cycle`: one cycle-accurate engine alone, from reset (no QEMU,
270	// no --resume-from-qemu), transparent passthrough -- cycles surface in the
271	// engine's own output. Unlike fast, this must discover the vsim build(s) to
272	// resolve the engine (explicit --engine, else the sole one).
