402	  // is hybrid-only; --pc-start/--pc-end belong to --trigger pc specifically. Any
403	  // other mode/trigger would SILENTLY drop them and hand back a figure for the
404	  // wrong window (fast/cycle: the whole program; hybrid+marker: the marker
405	  // window), so reject instead of measuring something the user did not ask for.
406	  if (!cli.trigger.empty() && cli.model != "hybrid") {
